@startuml
title 黑马智能学习辅助系统 — 分层架构（v0.5，组件视图）
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

package "app（组合根）" as app {
  [Main]
  [ApplicationBootstrap]
}

package "ui（表现层）" as ui {
  [ConsoleIO / TablePrinter]
  [Menu / MenuItem / MenuAction]
  [MenuFactory（接口）]
  [AdminMenuFactory / TeacherMenuFactory]
  [LoginUI]
  [DepartmentUI ... WarningUI]
}

package "service（应用层）" as service {
  [AuthService ... WarningService]
  [Session（含可见范围）]
}

package "dto（结果对象）" as dto {
  [ClassStatistics / CourseStatistics]
  [StudentStatistics / ScoreDetail]
  [RankEntry / StudentMetrics]
  [WarningResult / ClassWarning]
  [WarningLevel / ClassWarningLevel]
  [DataStatus]
}

package "model（领域层）" as model {
  [Identifiable / AbstractEntity]
  [Person / Employee / Student]
  [Department / Course]
  [SchoolClass / ClassCourse / Score]
  [Gender / Role / 状态枚举]
}

package "persistence（持久化）" as persistence {
  [Repository<T>]
  [CsvCodec<T> / CsvRepository<T>]
  [DataLoader / DataInitializer / LoadDiagnostics]
}

package "util（工具）" as util {
  [PasswordHasher]
  [CsvUtil / Validators / Dates]
}

' 依赖方向：上层指向下层；service 只依赖 Repository<T> 接口。
app --> ui
app --> service
app --> persistence
app --> util

ui --> service
ui --> dto

service --> model
service --> dto
service --> persistence : 仅 Repository<T>
service --> util

persistence --> model
persistence --> util

note right of service
  业务规则集中在 service；
  UI 只做输入解析与结果打印。
end note

note right of persistence
  service 只依赖 Repository<T> 接口，
  由 ApplicationBootstrap 注入
  CsvRepository<T> 实现。
end note

note bottom of persistence
  加载顺序：departments → employees → courses
  → classes → class_courses → students → scores。
  单文件临时文件 + 原子替换；无跨文件事务。
end note

note bottom of app
  ApplicationBootstrap 是唯一组合根：
  创建仓储、编解码器、服务与 UI，并完成构造器注入。
end note

@enduml
